      { text: "He tried to hide behind a cloud.\nHe was feeling very small.\nThe night felt far too big.\nHe wished for some more light.", emotion: "Sad" },
      { text: "But the big moon said to him,\n'You have a light inside you!'\nHe looked down at his sparkle.\nHe was so very surprised.", emotion: "Surprised" },
      { text: "The little star took a breath\nand he sparkled with all his might.\nHe shone brighter than before.\nHe felt so very brave.", emotion: "Confident" },
